sequenceDiagram
    actor M as Mahasiswa
    participant K as KRS Manager
    participant P as Prerequisite Validator
    participant S as SKS Validator
    participant J as Schedule Validator
    participant DB as Database
    participant D as Dosen PA

    M->>K: submitKRS(daftar mata kuliah)
    K->>P: cek prasyarat
    P->>DB: ambil riwayat nilai
    DB-->>P: data nilai
    P-->>K: hasil prasyarat
    alt prasyarat gagal
        K-->>M: ditolak: prasyarat belum terpenuhi
    else prasyarat lulus
        K->>S: cek total SKS <= 24
        S-->>K: hasil batas SKS
        K->>J: cek bentrok jadwal
        J->>DB: ambil jadwal mata kuliah
        DB-->>J: data jadwal
        J-->>K: hasil bentrok
        alt ada pelanggaran
            K-->>M: ditolak + alasan validasi
        else seluruh validasi lulus
            K->>DB: simpan status SUBMITTED
            K-->>M: KRS menunggu persetujuan
            K-->>D: notifikasi permohonan KRS
        end
    end

